### Summary by researcher
# Retrieves aggregated GPU run metrics grouped by researcher.
GET http://localhost:8000/summary
Accept: application/json

### Waste runs with low GPU utilization
# Retrieves rows where GPU utilization is below 50%.
GET http://localhost:8000/waste
Accept: application/json

### Runs grouped by model
# Retrieves counts and aggregate GPU hours per model.
GET http://localhost:8000/by-model
Accept: application/json

### Daily GPU hours trend
# Retrieves total GPU hours and run counts per calendar date.
GET http://localhost:8000/trend
Accept: application/json
